      "message": "[error] Line 14: 🔴 The account directory filter is overly restrictive: `Regex(\"[0-9a-fA-F]{1,16}\")` only accepts up to 16 hex chars, but Jami account IDs are longer in practice. This causes valid account trees to be silently excluded from export/restore (`transferEntries`, `restorePath`, and `applyPending` paths all depend on this), yielding successful-looking transfers with missing account data. Use the real account-id format/length used by the daemon (or validate against known account IDs) so complete account directories are actually transferred.",
